<title>CHINA: HON KWOK LAND YR NET PROFIT UP 48 PCT.</title>
<headline>HON KWOK LAND YR NET PROFIT UP 48 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   58.1	  vs 39.2 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    13.5	  vs 10.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  444.89 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    526.50	vs 354.91</p>
<p>    Turnover		     143.21	vs 631.68</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hon Kwok Land Investment Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 22-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 8</p>
<p>NOTE - Hon Kwok Land is a property group.</p>
<p>The company proposed a special cash bonus of 3.5 H.K. cents per share and a bonus issue of one-for-10 shares held.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain mainly on disposal of an investment property and compensation on acquisition of a portion of land by the local authority.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings have been adjusted to reflect the bonus issue during the year.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year is 20.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 3.5 cents and special cash bonus) vs 14 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
